vdbvisualizetree | VDB Visualize Tree | Builds a geometry visualizing the topology of a VDB.
vdbvisualizevelocity | VDB Visualize Velocity | Traces streamers through a velocity VDB.
vectorxform | Vector Transform | Transforms values of an RGB layer, attribute, or Vector VDB in 3D space.
vectorxform2d | Vector Transform 2D | Transforms the values of a UV layer or attribute in 2D space.
vignette | Vignette | Darkens the corners of an input layer.
visualizevelocity | Visualize Velocity | Creates an RGBA Layer visualizing a 2d velocity field.
weave | Weave | Generates a woven fabric pattern of interlacing fibers.
wipe | Wipe | Performs a wipe transition between two images.
worleynoise | Worley Noise | Generates Worley noise.
worleynoise3d | Worley Noise 3D | Generates Worley noise from 3D locations.
wrangle | Wrangle | Runs a VEX snippet to modify layer values.
xform | Transform 3D | Transforms a layer in 3D.
xform2d | Transform 2D | Transforms a layer in 2D.
zcomp | Z Composite | Composites two layers by depth.
